# Android native (Expo prebuild + custom native/widget). iOS `/ios/*` + `!` 화이트리스트와 대칭.
# `prebuild --clean`은 android/를 삭제 후 재생성하므로, Firebase 원본은 android/ 밖 `android-firebase/`에 둠 (iOS `ios/awallet/GoogleService-Info.plist`와 동일 역할).
/android/*
!/android/.gitignore
!/android/build.gradle
!/android/settings.gradle
!/android/node-path.gradle
!/android/tools/
!/android/tools/node
!/android/local.properties.example
!/android/keystore.properties.example
!/android/gradle.properties
!/android/gradlew
!/android/gradlew.bat
!/android/gradle/
/android/gradle/*
!/android/gradle/wrapper/
/android/gradle/wrapper/*
!/android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.properties
!/android/gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar
!/android/app/
/android/app/*
!/android/app/build.gradle
!/android/app/proguard-rules.pro
!/android/app/debug.keystore
!/android/app/src/
/android/app/src/*
!/android/app/src/main/
/android/app/src/main/*
!/android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
!/android/app/src/main/java/
!/android/app/src/main/java/**
!/android/app/src/debug/
/android/app/src/debug/*
!/android/app/src/debug/AndroidManifest.xml
!/android/app/src/debugOptimized/
/android/app/src/debugOptimized/*
!/android/app/src/debugOptimized/AndroidManifest.xml
# 위젯·네이티브 리소스 (추가 시 커밋). 아이콘·폰트 등 prebuild 산출 res는 제외.
!/android/app/src/main/res/xml/
!/android/app/src/main/res/xml/**
!/android/app/src/main/res/layout/
!/android/app/src/main/res/layout/monthly_expense_widget.xml
!/android/app/src/main/res/drawable/
!/android/app/src/main/res/drawable/widget_*
!/android/app/src/main/res/values/widget_dimens.xml
!/android/app/src/main/res/values/widget_colors.xml
!/android/app/src/main/res/values/widget_strings.xml
!/android/app/src/main/res/values-night/widget_colors.xml
